WEBVTT

00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:32.922
that they say is most critical
to their success?

00:01:33.798 --> 00:01:36.217
Well, I think we know the answer ...

00:01:36.217 --> 00:01:37.969
or at least we think we do.

00:01:38.261 --> 00:01:42.849
The average professional
attends 62 meetings per month.

00:01:42.974 --> 00:01:45.101
That sounds pretty outrageous.

00:01:45.143 --> 00:01:46.144
How could that be?

00:01:46.394 --> 00:01:48.104
But if you actually break it down,

00:01:48.104 --> 00:01:49.105
it’s not that many.

00:01:49.105 --> 00:01:51.232
It’s two to three meetings per day,

00:01:51.232 --> 00:01:53.401
which is probably average for many of you.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.403
So 62 meetings a month.

00:01:55.736 --> 00:01:57.071
That does not help,

00:01:57.071 --> 00:01:58.906
and that is not wrong.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.324
It is a contributor.